          "key": "request_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Scope and authority boundary",
          "guidance": "This record supports operational reconciliation, not accounting, legal, or fraud conclusions. Do not record safe combinations, reusable credentials, full card or bank data, or unsupported accusations. During a threat, prioritize the approved emergency response and do not confront or pursue. Follow applicable cash, privacy, security, and retention policy and route judgment to the authorized reviewer."
        }
